<p>You now summon a Dreadmaster instead of a Dread.</p><p>Dreadmasters learn to cast silence, disperse magic and mind disruption, making them the ultimate annoyance tool.</p><p>It learns them at talent level <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5.</acronym></p>